recordings/

# What the file mailer and the file SMS sender write when no provider is
# configured: recap emails carrying somebody's commitment and their address,
# and missed-call texts carrying a reschedule link. Three comments in the
# source already claimed this directory was ignored. It was not, and one
# `git add -A` on the server would have committed a caller's week.
# Also the npm cache, which the systemd units point here.
runs/

